NOTE: 

The examples in this directory are described in the userguide.


Short description
-----------------

elastic1

 Elastic problem on a unit square (2D). Mooney-Rivlin solid.

elastic2

 Elastic bar in a Stokes fluid. Mooney-Rivlin solid.

elastic3

 Elastic problem on a unit cube (3D). Mooney-Rivlin solid.

elastic4

 Elastic bar in a Stokes fluid. Mooney-Rivlin solid.
 Weak constraint on the boundary (interface between solid and fluid).

elastic5

 Elastic bar in a Stokes fluid. Mooney-Rivlin solid.
 Weak distributed constraint on the full particle domain.
 Velocity profile sinusoidal in time.

elastic6

 Elastic problem on a unit square (2D). Mooney-Rivlin solid.
 Spectral elements.
 This problem is similar to elastic1, but now with spectral elements.

elastic7

 Elastic problem on a unit square (2D). Mooney-Rivlin solid.
 Crouzeix-Raviart Q2/P1 element.
 Optionally use global P1 interpolation for pressure.

elastic8

 Elastic problem on a unit cube (3D). Mooney-Rivlin solid.
 Crouzeix-Raviart Q2/P1 element. 
 Optionally use global P1 interpolation for pressure.
